语义保持一致。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **修复 `AngleV2_bf16` 输出 dtype**: 在 `angle_v2_binary.json` 中，将 `bin_filename` 为 `\"AngleV2_bf16\"` 的算子变体的输出 `y` 参数 `dtype` 从 `\"float32\"` 修正为 `\"bfloat16\"`，确保输入与输出数据类型一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T19:53:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T19:53:32+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177700975,"discussion_id":"aa61f3c6c695599e819d115d103d1e06ff5aab15","body":"\uD83E\uDD16 AI Code Review\n\n## ⚠️ 自定义模型 Provider 调用失败\n\n本次审查使用的自定义模型 Provider 无法正常调用，已停止重试。\n\n**请检查 Provider 配置：**\n- Base URL 是否正确、网络是否可达\n- API Key 是否有效\n- 模型名称是否存在\n\n修正配置后，重新触发审查即可。\n\n> 追踪 ID: `task-29992-run-28230`","created_at":"2026-06-29T19:57:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T19:57:27+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177701537,"discussion_id":"c070eeee5c79ae7429c4247a0fdf76e243418b6a","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-06-29T19:59:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T19:59:53+08:00","user":{"id":"694e41a663bb150764b9ee3c","login":"nextyale","object_id":"694e41a663bb150764b9ee3c","name":"nextyale","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/nextyale"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177701980,"discussion_id":"3ca105c5496da14dfc47be4d0565d2a159978051","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4a243b02d4dd4e5dad9d292c8ac8560e&pipelineRunId=3420802fcb7d4cf683ac88aad6bddca2&projectName=CANN'>3420802fcb7d4cf683ac88aad6